      "image": null,
      "assetSha": null,
      "payloadSha": "36cea27119c35b645ea5043cc288b207544fe0f8abe6441d7e079d491cdd8ff9"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "content": "다음 중 극한값으로 옳지 않은 것은? (4.2점)",
      "choices": [
        "$\\lim_{x\\to2}\\dfrac{x^3-8}{x-2}=12$",
        "$\\lim_{x\\to3}\\dfrac{(x-3)^2}{|x-3|}=0$",
        "$\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}(\\sqrt{x^2+6x+3}-x)=3$",
        "$\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{4x^2+5x-4}-x}{2x}=\\dfrac12$",
        "$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\dfrac1{x^2}\\left(1-\\dfrac5{x^2+5}\\right)=\\dfrac15$"
